# Copy to .env (git-ignored). Nothing here is required: Mock needs no setting. Never commit real secrets.
# The family's settings file ~/Development/.env (or STANDALONE_ENV) is read too; real environment variables win.

# Port (default 7802).
# PORT=7802

# Bind address. Default 127.0.0.1 (loopback only). Any other value is an explicit opt-in; the server then also accepts the
# Host names in LAB_ALLOWED_HOSTS (comma-separated).
# AGG_ENT_BIND=
# LAB_ALLOWED_HOSTS=

# Real mode: measure your own gateway's MCP aggregate apps. Each app is reached at <origin>/<app>/mcp.
# AGG_ENT_GW_URL=https://gateway.example.invalid
# AGG_ENT_GW_APPS=aggregate,aggregate-limited
# One agent access key per caller; the name after KEY_ becomes the caller's label. Write-only: never returned, shown or logged.
# AGG_ENT_GW_KEY_ANALYST=
# AGG_ENT_GW_KEY_GUEST=
